	<annotations>
		<text id="0" type="text/markdown" rect="(80.0, 200.0, 420.0, 260.0)" font-family="Sans Serif" font-size="16">*Chapter 9. Corpus (BBC3): move Title to Ignored so only Content is used. Each summarizer runs as soon as data arrives, and the first run of each model downloads it. Corpus Viewer: tick the summary column under Display Features. Ollama needs a running server with llama3.1:8b; connect Data Sampler to it yourself (about 3 minutes). 9C: Select Rows Chapter is 1. Group by Chapter: aggregate Paragraph (or the summary column) with Concatenate. In each Corpus widget make the joined column the text feature.*</text>
	</annotations>
